[E-REWRITE-CONG] Error: `rewrite` can't go inside the function passed to `total`: there is no `totalCong`
    ╭─[ reject/rewrite-inside-function-no-lemma.sw:12:11 ]
    │
 12 │   rewrite Nat.addZero _
    │           ──────┬──────  
    │                 ╰──────── looking for `?3 + 0`, which is in the goal only inside a function passed to `total`, where it uses the function's variable
    │ 
    │ Note 1: to rewrite inside a function passed to `total`, `rewrite` needs `totalCong`: `total`'s parameters in order, each function parameter twice (`f1`, `f2`), then `(x…) -> f1 x… = f2 x…` for each, proving `total … f1 … = total … f2 …` (as `List.sumByCong` does)
    │ 
    │ Note 2: such as `theorem totalCong (f1: Nat → Nat) (f2: Nat → Nat) (arg2: List Nat) (ef: (x: Nat) → f1 x = f2 x): total f1 arg2 = total f2 arg2`
